      "statement": "The two MCP gatekeepers share @gadgets/mcp-shared, which holds the client, OAuth, tool classification, scope grammar, and action store; each connector keeps its own vendor entrypoint, DO classes, migrations, env, connect form, and configurator UI, varying shared behavior only through named hooks.",
