    {
      "id": "claim_5595d20dd1ce4e83bd8dc64d0a0c6223",
      "statement": "tools.ts is the trust boundary: nothing outside it reads a tool's annotations. classifyTool makes readOnlyHint drive read-vs-action classification on both tiers, while auto-approving a write additionally requires a vetted endpoint plus destructiveHint false and idempotentHint true, and every annotation test is strict === true/false so an unannotated tool is an action that can never auto-apply.",
