    {
      "id": "claim_9e0b2032600743be86beeb4b0521c7bf",
      "statement": "The trust tier (byo/vetted) is deployment configuration read at each point of use: a user-supplied endpoint gets 'byo' (readOnlyHint classifies reads but no claim can auto-apply a write), and only the portal can produce a 'vetted' endpoint, and only with MCP_PORTAL_TRUST_ANNOTATIONS=true.",
