    {
      "id": "claim_9206555e694b46f3abe729d4fb269f8a",
      "statement": "A grant's breadth is encoded in the resource URL fragment: no fragment means the whole endpoint, #server= names one portal upstream, #tool= names exact wire tools, and parsing fails closed (a tool key yielding nothing, or the obsolete tools key, produces an empty restriction rather than whole-endpoint access). scopeAllows enforces membership per call and excludes portal_* tools on a detected portal.",
