      "statement": "User-supplied endpoints are validated at connect time (https required, private/loopback/metadata/.internal hosts blocked, URL credentials refused), and the host blocklist is only a legible refusal: the real SSRF boundary is the global_fetch_strictly_public compatibility flag in each connector's wrangler.jsonc, which rejects reserved IP ranges after DNS resolution on every request and redirect hop.",
