      "id": "claim_9c48d96eac7848f9abade481550d4d48",
      "statement": "The portal recovers upstream servers from its contract — every tool is named {server_id}_{name} (membership is a pure string test) and portal_list_servers lists them — using a capability probe rather than a hostname match, with a truncated listing still counting as a portal so the portal_* exclusion cannot fail open; portal_* tools are excluded from every grant at every scope.",
