      "statement": "Changing MCP_PORTAL_URL on a deployment with connected accounts is a repoint: existing bindings fail closed at once (the account refuses credentials for any endpoint other than its recorded one), the account advances a persisted generation so late-returning refreshes and session writes under the old generation are ignored, and only reconnect accepts the new endpoint.",
